                            rdfs:range cidoc:E31_Document;
                            rdfs:subPropertyOf cidoc:P67i_is_referred_to_by.
cidoc:P71_lists a rdf:Property;
                rdfs:comment """This property documents a source E32 Authority Document for an instance of an E1 CRM Entity.
